msgid ""
"Cast off from Carvoeiro and follow the cliffs — under the arches, into "
"Benagil’s dome, out to where the dolphins run."
msgstr ""
"Zarpe do Carvoeiro e siga as falésias — sob os arcos, dentro da cúpula "
"de Benagil, até onde andam os golfinhos."

