#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:358
msgid "Enjoy Algarve's spectacular coast"
msgstr "Desfrute da espetacular costa algarvia"

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:197 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:224
msgid "is only visible from the sea."
msgstr "só se vê do mar."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:206 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:231
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:285 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:315
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:361
msgid ""
"Take a boat tour with us, or row in a kayak, and make your way to the many "
"beautiful caves in the Algarve's coastline."
msgstr ""
"Faça um passeio de barco connosco ou reme num caiaque e explore as belas "
"grutas da costa algarvia."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:209 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:234
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:296 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:326
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:372
msgid ""
"🐬 Corvine and other kinds of dolphins and wildlife are common sight in our "
"coasts, and add to the magical experience of a great holiday here."
msgstr ""
"🐬 As corvinas e outras espécies de golfinhos e animais selvagens são "
"comuns  nas nossas costas e contribuem para a experiência mágica de umas "
"férias fantásticas aqui."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:212 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:237
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:312 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:342
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:388
msgid ""
"The Algarve’s coastline is known for its beautiful cliffs, rock formations, "
"grottos, and many sea caves."
msgstr ""
"A costa algarvia é conhecida pelas suas belas arribas, formações rochosas, "
"grutas e numerosas cavernas marinhas."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:215 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:240
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:320 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:350
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:396
msgid ""
"While it’s possible to enjoy the beauty of the coast from land, seeing it "
"from the sea is a unique experience."
msgstr ""
"Embora seja possível apreciar a beleza da costa por terra, vê-la do mar é "
"uma experiência única."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:231 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:257
