msgstr "2 horas"

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:361 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:385
msgid ""
"Join a boat tour to the caves and the dolphins, or take a kayak out on your "
"own. Either way, the cliffs look their best from sea level."
msgstr ""
"Junte-se a um passeio de barco às grutas e aos golfinhos, ou leve um caiaque "
"à sua conta. De qualquer forma, as falésias são mais bonitas ao nível do mar."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:362 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:394
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:509 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:607
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:628 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:652
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:654
msgid "Boarding location"
msgstr "Local de embarque"

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:367 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:399
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:514 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:612
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:657
msgid ""
"This program includes a brief stop by the beach to dive whenever be possible."
msgstr ""
"Este programa inclui uma breve paragem na praia para mergulho, sempre que "
"possível."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:371 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:403
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:518 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:616
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:661
msgid ""
"Experience the breathtaking beauty of Portugal's stunning Algarve coastline "
"on this tour. The boarding is done in Carvoeiro, we provide transport to "
"Ferragudo to start the tour."
msgstr ""
"Descubra a beleza estonteante da deslumbrante costa algarvia, em Portugal, "
"nesta excursão. O embarque é feito em Carvoeiro e nós providenciamos o "
"transporte até Ferragudo para o início do passeio."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:372 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:396
msgid ""
"Dolphins are a common sight along this coast and often come to ride the bow. "
"Seeing them in the wild is the part guests remember longest."
msgstr ""
"Os golfinhos são presença habitual nesta costa e muitas vezes vêm brincar à "
"proa. Vê-los em liberdade é a parte de que os hóspedes mais se lembram."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:375 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:407
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:522 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:620
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:665
msgid ""
"We are a team of professionals, passionate about the sea, who are dedicated "
"to their work to make your trip a unique and unforgettable moment!"
msgstr ""
"Somos uma equipa de profissionais apaixonados pelo mar, dedicados ao nosso "
"trabalho para tornar a sua viagem num momento único e inesquecível!"

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:378 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:402
msgid "Kayaks & paddling"
msgstr "Caiaques e remo"

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:379 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:411
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:526 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:624
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:669
msgid ""
"The trip will start heading to the dolphins habitat and on the way back we "
"visit Praia da Marinha, Algar de Benagil, Olhos de Deus, the largest cave in "
"the Algarve, and much more."
msgstr ""
"A excursão terá início com uma visita ao habitat dos golfinhos e, no "
"regresso, visitaremos a Praia da Marinha, o Algar de Benagil, os Olhos de "
"Deus, a maior gruta do Algarve, e muito mais."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:383 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:415
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:530 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:628
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:673
msgid ""
"Our professionals like to share their extensive knowledge about the region, "
"as well as marine life, and the local ecosystem, ensuring that all our "
"passengers can fully understand and appreciate the wonderful marine life."
msgstr ""
"Os nossos profissionais gostam de partilhar o seu vasto conhecimento sobre a "
"região, bem como sobre a vida marinha e o ecossistema local, garantindo que "
"todos os nossos passageiros possam compreender e apreciar plenamente a "
"maravilhosa vida marinha."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:387 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:419
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:535 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:633
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:654 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:678
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:680
msgid "Health & Safety"
msgstr "Saúde e Segurança"

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:388 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:412
msgid ""
"Benagil’s dome, the heart-shaped window and caves you can only reach by "
"water — this is the stretch everyone comes for."
msgstr ""
"A cúpula de Benagil, a janela em forma de coração e grutas a que só se chega "
"por água — é este o troço que todos vêm ver."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:389 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:421
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:537 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:635
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:680
msgid ""
"We do not recommend the speed boat tour to people with serious back "
"problems, or weighing more than 120kg and pregnant women in late stages of "
"pregnancy."
msgstr ""
"Não recomendamos o passeio de lancha a pessoas com problemas graves de "
"coluna, com peso superior a 120 kg ou a grávidas em estado avançado de "
"gestação."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:392 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:424
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:540 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:638
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:659 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:683
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:685
msgid "Included"
msgstr "Incluído"

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:393 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:425
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:541 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:639
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:684
msgid "Life jacket, Waterproofing when necessary."
msgstr "Colete salva-vidas, impermeabilização quando necessário."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:396 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:428
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:544 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:642
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:664 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:687
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:690
msgid "Not included"
msgstr "Não incluído"

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:396 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:420
msgid ""
"You can walk the clifftops, but the arches, the hidden beaches and the sheer "
"scale of the rock only make sense from below."
msgstr ""
"Pode caminhar no topo das falésias, mas os arcos, as praias escondidas e a "
"escala da rocha só fazem sentido visto de baixo."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:397 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:429
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:545 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:643
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:688
msgid "Swimsuit, towel, sun lotion, sunglasses."
msgstr "Fato de banho, toalha, protetor solar, óculos de sol."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:400 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:432
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:548 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:646
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:669 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:691
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:695
msgid "Cancellation policy"
msgstr "Política de cancelamento"

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:402 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:434
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:550 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:648
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:693
msgid ""
"For a full refund, cancel at least 24 hours in advance of the tour start "
"date."
msgstr ""
"Para obter o reembolso total, cancele com pelo menos 24 horas de "
"antecedência da data de início do passeio."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:407 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:431
msgid ""
"Two hours on the water, a small group and a skipper who knows every arch. "
"Reserve your place before you arrive."
msgstr ""
"Duas horas no mar, um grupo pequeno e um skipper que conhece cada arco. "
"Reserve o seu lugar antes de chegar."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:433 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:457
msgid "Licensed and insured"
msgstr "Licenciados e segurados"

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:435 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:459
msgid ""
"Registered with the Municipal Chamber of Lagoa, licence E/8399/2023, issued "
"13 March 2023."
msgstr ""
"Registados na Câmara Municipal de Lagoa, licença E/8399/2023, emitida a 13 "
"de março de 2023."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:438 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:462
msgid ""
"Civil liability insurance, policy no. 85/25935 (maritime tourism): €50,000."
msgstr ""
"Seguro de responsabilidade civil, apólice n.º 85/25935 (turismo marítimo): "
"50 000 €."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:441 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:465
msgid "Death or permanent disability: €1,120,000."
msgstr "Morte ou invalidez permanente: 1 120 000 €."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:444 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:468
msgid "Treatment and repatriation: €196,000."
msgstr "Tratamento e repatriamento: 196 000 €."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:455 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:479
msgid ""
"Read what other guests said — and if you enjoyed the ride, a few words from "
"you help others find us."
msgstr ""
"Leia o que dizem outros hóspedes — e, se gostou do passeio, umas palavras "
"suas ajudam outros a encontrar-nos."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:485 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:508
msgid "Where to find us"
msgstr "Onde nos encontrar"

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:487 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:510
msgid "Open daily, 09:00–18:00."
msgstr "Aberto todos os dias, das 09:00 às 18:00."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:488 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:518
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:556 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:557
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:579
msgid "Map showing the location of our business"
msgstr "Mapa com a localização do nosso negócio"

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:489 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:512
msgid ""
"You will find us on the sand at Praia do Carvoeiro — just look for the boats."
msgstr ""
"Encontra-nos na areia da Praia do Carvoeiro — basta procurar os barcos."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:493 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:516
msgid ""
"Booking ahead is kindest: it means we can save you a seat on the boat you "
"want."
msgstr ""
"Reservar com antecedência é o melhor: assim guardamos-lhe lugar no barco que "
"preferir."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:512 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:535
msgid ""
"Reservations, questions, or a tip about the sea that day — message us and we "
"will answer."
msgstr ""
"Reservas, dúvidas ou uma dica sobre o mar desse dia — escreva-nos e "
"respondemos."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:532 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:570
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:571 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:593
msgid "Carvoeiro & Benagil in panorama"
msgstr "Carvoeiro e Benagil em panorama"

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:534 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:573
msgid ""
"Take the photograph by its edge and pull: the view turns the way it does "
"from the boat."
msgstr ""
"Puxe a fotografia pela margem: a vista gira como gira a partir do barco."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:544 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:567
msgid "Calls to a Portuguese mobile may be charged by your operator."
msgstr ""
"As chamadas para um telemóvel português podem ser cobradas pela sua "
"operadora."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:546 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:586
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:587 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:610
msgid "Carvoeiro beach"
msgstr "Praia do Carvoeiro"

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:554 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:596
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:597 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:621
msgid "Benagil cave"
msgstr "Gruta de Benagil"

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:566 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:610
#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:611 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:636
msgid "Drag to look around"
msgstr "Arraste para olhar em volta"

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:572 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:595
msgid ""
"Drag the photograph sideways, from the beach at Carvoeiro to the roof of the "
"Benagil cave."
msgstr ""
"Arraste a fotografia para o lado, da praia do Carvoeiro à abóbada da gruta "
"de Benagil."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:630 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:656
msgid "Praia do Carvoeiro, with free transport to Ferragudo"
msgstr "Praia do Carvoeiro, com transporte gratuito até Ferragudo"

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:633 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:659
msgid "Weather permitting, we stop by a beach for a swim along the way."
msgstr ""
"Se o tempo deixar, fazemos uma paragem numa praia para um mergulho pelo "
"caminho."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:637 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:663
msgid ""
"We meet you at Praia do Carvoeiro and drive you to Ferragudo, where the boat "
"is waiting. From there it is two hours of cliffs, caves and open water."
msgstr ""
"Encontramo-nos na Praia do Carvoeiro e levamos até Ferragudo, onde o barco "
"espera. Daí são duas horas de falésias, grutas e mar aberto."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:641 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:667
msgid ""
"We are a small team who grew up on this coast. We know which cave is worth "
"the detour and where the dolphins usually are — and we will tell you the "
"stories behind both."
msgstr ""
"Somos uma equipa pequena, criada nesta costa. Sabemos que gruta merece o "
"desvio e onde costumam andar os golfinhos — e contamos as histórias de ambos."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:645 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:671
msgid ""
"We head out to the dolphins' feeding grounds first, then turn back along the "
"coast: Praia da Marinha, Algar de Benagil, Olhos de Deus, the largest cave "
"in the Algarve, and a few places with no name at all."
msgstr ""
"Saímos primeiro ao encontro dos golfinhos, nas suas zonas de alimentação, e "
"depois voltamos ao longo da costa: Praia da Marinha, Algar de Benagil, Olhos "
"de Deus, a maior gruta do Algarve e alguns lugares sem nome."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:649 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:675
msgid ""
"Our skippers talk about the marine life and the local ecosystem as we go, so "
"you leave knowing more than when you stepped aboard."
msgstr ""
"Os nossos skippers falam da vida marinha e do ecossistema local ao longo do "
"passeio, para que saia a saber mais do que quando entrou a bordo."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:656 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:682
msgid ""
"The speedboat is not suitable for people with serious back problems, anyone "
"weighing more than 120 kg, or late-stage pregnancy."
msgstr ""
"O barco não é adequado a pessoas com problemas graves de coluna, a quem pese "
"mais de 120 kg ou a grávidas em fase final de gravidez."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:661 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:687
msgid "Life jacket, and waterproof bags when the sea asks for them."
msgstr "Colete salva-vidas e sacos impermeáveis quando o mar os pedir."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:666 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:692
msgid "Swimsuit, towel, sun cream and sunglasses — bring your own."
msgstr "Fato de banho, toalha, protetor solar e óculos de sol — traga os seus."

#: src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:671 src/carvoeiro-water-fun/html.scm:697
msgid "Cancel at least 24 hours before departure for a full refund."
msgstr "Cancele com pelo menos 24 horas de antecedência para reembolso total."
